# Sit on a chair (STYLE_P2 15, 19 item 5; the slice, P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; POSES-B folds it into its postures in wave 2).
# A chair-height sitter (SLICE-SIT-HEIGHT): the pivot is the floor under the feet, the hips on the seat line 7 rows over it
# (HOLDERS' kSeat 5 + 2, A3's knee; seatFit2 seats it; the legs' `hip` mark reports it for P2), so the whole upper body sits
# 2 rows lower than standing (bob 2) and every seated figure's top is 2 art px under the same figure standing. Front: the
# thighs foreshortened into a 3-row lap with the knees apart, short shins, the hands resting on the thighs (arms `lap`), a
# skirt's lap shelf with the knees under it (hang sit). Back: the bust on the seat, the forearms forward out of sight, nothing
# under the seat line (the seat shows there). Sides: the thigh level on the seat, the shin down to the floor, the near hand on
# the knee (F); a scabbard lies back along the seat (sheath sit). One frame, as postureInfo's Sit.
body man
clip idle D posture sit
f armL=lap armR=lap hang=sit legs=sit neck=rest sheath=rest torso=rest bob=2
clip idle U posture sit
f armL=lap armR=lap hang=sit legs=sit neck=rest sheath=sit torso=rest bob=2
clip idle R posture sit
f armL=- armR=F hang=sit legs=sit neck=rest sheath=sit torso=rest bob=2
clip idle L posture sit
f armL=F armR=- hang=sit legs=sit neck=rest sheath=sit torso=rest bob=2

body woman
clip idle D posture sit
f armL=lap armR=lap hair=rest hang=sit legs=sit sheath=rest torso=rest bob=2
clip idle U posture sit
f armL=lap armR=lap hair=rest hang=sit legs=sit sheath=sit torso=rest bob=2
clip idle R posture sit
f armL=- armR=F hair=rest hang=sit legs=sit sheath=sit torso=rest bob=2
clip idle L posture sit
f armL=F armR=- hair=rest hang=sit legs=sit sheath=sit torso=rest bob=2
